usage: producer_session.py [-h]
                           {preflight,build,qualify,measure,report,diagnose,s3-worker}
                           [{baseline,producer}]

Bounded producer experiment operations. No provisioning or remote action. Run
only through examples/sessions/qwen_producer.py after explicit GPU approval.
The report can run offline. It refuses partial correctness or timing evidence.

positional arguments:
  {preflight,build,qualify,measure,report,diagnose,s3-worker}
  {baseline,producer}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
